Source: dbc-dxfs-dccapp-runner
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DXFS Maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), desktop-file-utils, shared-mime-info
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/kdegeek/DBC_DXFS

Package: dbc-dxfs-dccapp-runner
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, xdg-utils, gnome-keyring | seahorse | libsecret-1-0
Description: DB/C DX .dccapp runner and desktop integration
 Provides a DCCAPL-compatible launcher that reads .dccapp files and invokes
 the DB/C DX runtime on Linux. Prompts for username/password if not provided
 and stores them securely via Secret Service (if available) for future use.
 All sensitive endpoints and credentials are read at runtime (not stored in the repo).
